        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "BMD benefits from a committed manufacturing partnership, Wood Products enjoys superior access to the market through a committed distributor, and we capture margin at both levels of the supply chain.",
